# Slack Incoming Webhook URL for test result DM notifications
# Instructions to get your webhook URL:
# 1. Go to https://api.slack.com/apps and create a new app (or use an existing one)
# 2. Enable "Incoming Webhooks" under Features
# 3. Click "Add New Webhook to Workspace" and select your DM with yourself
# 4. Copy the webhook URL and paste it below
SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.slack.com/services/YOUR/WEBHOOK/URL